@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / create account
CreateAccount : do / validate registration
CreateAccount : exit / Login / Invalid registration

state "Invalid Registration" as InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration : entry / invalid registration
InvalidRegistration : do / cannot register
InvalidRegistration : exit / Abnormal termination

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / login
Login : do / validate username and password
Login : exit / CheckWeather / Invalid login

state "Check Weather" as CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry / check weather
CheckWeather : do / get current location or new location
CheckWeather : exit / ChooseWeather / Invalid location

state "Choose Weather" as ChooseWeather
ChooseWeather : entry / choose what to check
ChooseWeather : do / validate selection
ChooseWeather : exit / ShowWeather / Invalid selection

state "Show Weather" as ShowWeather
ShowWeather : entry / show selected weather information
ShowWeather : do / update and display information
ShowWeather : exit / ViewDetails / No additional details needed

state "View Details" as ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / view additional details
ViewDetails : do / validate selection
ViewDetails : exit / Logout / Invalid selection

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / logout
Logout : do / end session
Logout : exit / [*]

[*] --> Login

Login --> CreateAccount
CreateAccount --> Login
InvalidRegistration --> [*]
Login --> CheckWeather
CheckWeather --> ChooseWeather
ChooseWeather --> ShowWeather
ShowWeather --> ViewDetails
ViewDetails --> Logout
Logout --> [*]

@enduml
